stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open
    Open --> InProgress
    Open --> OnHold
    Open --> Closed
    InProgress --> Open
    InProgress --> OnHold
    InProgress --> Closed
    OnHold --> Open
    OnHold --> InProgress
    Open --> Resolved
    InProgress --> Resolved
    OnHold --> Resolved
    OnHold --> Closed
    Resolved --> Open: Requester reopens own ticket
    Resolved --> InProgress: Staff reopens
    Resolved --> OnHold: Staff reopens
    Resolved --> Closed: Staff closes
    Closed --> Open: reopenClosedTickets capability
    note right of Open
        Default initial status is Open.
        setTicketStatus allows any initial status and
        any transition from a non-Closed status.
        Requesters may only reopen their own Resolved ticket to Open.
    end note
